 "key_insight": "RSPCA still shows no Staffy page to pick: neither its 471-URL map nor a search map for the breed's name returned one, though the search map did return other breeds' buying guides in the same puppy folder. Its fetched pages speak to any dog, carry no schema and price no animal, so its Staffy buying and price rankings rest on the charity's authority; BSUK can meet those searches with a Staffy-specific buying and price guide that walks through the welfare checks RSPCA tells every buyer to make."
